# Context for instances/server/Dockerfile, which builds from the repository root.
#
# The server bundle inlines every @arxhub/* package from its TypeScript SOURCE, and pnpm needs a
# package.json for every workspace pattern in pnpm-workspace.yaml or --frozen-lockfile rejects the
# lockfile. So no workspace directory may be excluded here — only build output, installed modules,
# and the parts of the repo no build reads.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Rust/Tauri output — gigabytes, and the desktop bundle is not built here.
instances/app/src-tauri/target
instances/app/src-tauri/gen

# Test and tool output.
e2e/test-results
e2e/playwright-report
e2e/.cache
**/.vite
**/.vite-temp
**/coverage

.git
.github
.vscode
.claude
.idea

# Documentation and design references — no build step reads them.
forge-wiki
refs
**/*.md

**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
